Firmware
--------
Camera firmware is the property of OM Digital Solutions Corporation. This repository contains NO firmware, no decoded image, no dump, no
disassembly listing, no patch list and no body-specific table. You use it with firmware you have downloaded yourself, locally. Do not
redistribute firmware or anything derived from it. Run tools/leakcheck.py before every push.

No warranty
-----------
Nothing here writes to a camera. Never flash an image because an emulator or this toolkit passed: a passing emulator is evidence, not proof,
and modified firmware can brick a camera.
